| Test | Required outcome |
|---|---|
| Missing, malformed, reused, or duplicate-ID key configuration | Readiness fails |
| Token, version, key ID, or tag tampering | Authentication fails |
| Noncanonical base64url and oversized cookie | Authentication fails |
